==Battleground==
*10 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn, delay 1~6 seconds<sup>30f~180f</sup>.
*1 [[Mooth]] spawns.
*Infinite [[Sir Rel]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 6~18 seconds<sup>180f~540f</sup>.
*1 [[Othom]] spawns after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>.
*1 [[J.K. Bun Bun]] spawns as the boss after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
J.K. Bun Bun and Othom both spawn on a timer, so it is possible to rush the stage by killing Mooth quickly.

[[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fishman Cat]] will help you rush down Mooth, and [[Slime Cat (Rare Cat)|Jellycat]] can be used to get rid of the Squire Rels. [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]] and [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] can prove to be useful as well. Once Mooth is dead, spawn [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] to finish off the base.

If you are unable to rush the stage, note that it's rather cash-tight. [[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Octopus Cat]] with its Curse Immunity [[Talents|Talent]] can be of great use, and 3 meatshields will be enough to stall J.K. Bun Bun.

