==Trivia==
*Inspirational Mural's Japanese name, Kawaii Hekiga (かわいい壁画, "Cute Mural"), implies the opposite of the scarier [[Mural of the Devil]].
*Prior to the [[Version 11.0 Update]], [[J.K. Bun Bun]] was buffed to 600% instead of 500% on 1-crown difficulty.

